/**
 * Default theme "Dev" (routes / and /es/).
 * The portfolio as a modern developer tool: the hero is a tool landing (a `whoami`
 * readout derived from the resume plus a live command palette, also on ⌘K / Ctrl+K / "/"
 * anywhere) that searches every section, the design method as a
 * pipeline run with an inspector, the career as a release changelog, projects as
 * repository cards and skills as a settings panel. Standalone page: it does not load the
 * main site's JS or Tailwind.
 */
